    "objects": {
      "general": [
        {
          "properties": {
            "paragraphs": [
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "About this page - Where the exposure is",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontWeight": "bold",
                      "fontSize": "18pt"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": ""
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "What this page is for",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "14pt",
                      "color": "#9cbce8"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": ""
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Attrition costs MPG ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "12pt"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": "$83.3M",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontWeight": "bold",
                      "fontSize": "12pt"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": " over the next twelve months if nothing changes: 599 voluntary exits, each valued at the leaver's salary times the cost of replacing them.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "12pt"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": ""
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "That cost is not spread evenly, and it does not sit where the exits sit. ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "12pt"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": "Bogotá lost 148 people — two and a half times more than any other city — and ranks fourth in exposure. Dublin lost 79, barely half, and ranks first.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontWeight": "bold",
                      "fontSize": "12pt"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": " Exposure is exits multiplied by salary and by replacement cost, and LATAM salaries are lower. Counting heads and counting dollars point at different cities, and both readings are right for different questions.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "12pt"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": ""
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "This page sizes the problem. It does not say which teams to act on. Four of 746 cells trip a rule; the scan on the next page is where they are named and where the evidence for each one is shown.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "12pt"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": ""
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "The figures on this page",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "14pt",
                      "color": "#9cbce8"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": ""
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Attrition Exposure USD",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontWeight": "bold",
                      "fontSize": "12pt"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": " ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "12pt"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Voluntary exits over the last twelve months, times average base salary, times the replacement factor. What the current rate costs over the next twelve months if nothing changes.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "12pt"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": ""
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Replacement Factor",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontWeight": "bold",
                      "fontSize": "12pt"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": " ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "12pt"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "A declared assumption, not a measurement. 0.5× salary for Operations, 1.0× for corporate functions, 1.5× for Engineering, Data, Product and Sales, 2.0× for managers. HR literature puts the range between 0.5× and 2×; the position taken here is to state the figure and test its sensitivity, not to defend it.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "12pt"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": ""
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Voluntary Exits LTM",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontWeight": "bold",
                      "fontSize": "12pt"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": " ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "12pt"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Departures the employee chose. Involuntary exits and internal transfers are excluded — only the first is a retention problem.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "12pt"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": ""
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Segments With A Rule Fired",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontWeight": "bold",
                      "fontSize": "12pt"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Cells tripping at least one of the three prioritisation rules. A cell tripping two counts once: the question is how many places need a conversation, not how many diagnoses were issued.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "12pt"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": ""
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Attrition vs Baseline",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontWeight": "bold",
                      "fontSize": "12pt"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": " ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "12pt"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "A cell's attrition rate divided by the company rate. 1.00 is the company average, and the reference holds still when you filter.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "12pt"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": ""
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "The matrix",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontWeight": "bold",
                      "fontSize": "12pt"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": " ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "12pt"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "City by job family, shown only where thirty or more people sit in the cell. That floor covers 88 % of the population; below it, a ratio computed on eight people is noise wearing the clothes of a finding.",
                    "textStyle": {
